        {
          "text": "Atunyamuke, tuye ku-Beteli, nkayake cipaililo, cibe ca-Leza oyo iwakandivuwa mubuzuba bwamafwabi aangu, iwakandisindikila mukweenda kwangu koonse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.3",
