          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo bakapa Jakobo baleza beenzu boonse ibakali mumaanza aabo amacoco aamumatwi aabo, nkabela Jakobo wakazisisa kunsi lyamubanga waku-Sekemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.4",
