        {
          "text": "Elyo mukweenda kwabo, buyoofu buzwa kuli-Leza bwakajata minzi iyakeengelede, aboobo teebakatobela bana ba-Jakobo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.5",
