        {
          "text": "Mpawo Jakobo wakasika kuli-Izaka wisi ku-Mamre, ku-Kiriyati-ariba (ngonguwo Hebroni), Abrahamu a-Izaka nkubakali kukala-kala. ",
          "type": "text",
